# WExSEE E-School — Environment Variables
# Replace these values with your actual project keys from https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api
# Configure Google in Supabase Authentication > Sign In / Providers > Google.
# Add your Vite URL plus /auth/callback to Supabase's allowed redirect URLs.
# For example, Vite may use http://localhost:5173 or http://localhost:5174.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here
